## Key Learning Areas

- Selenium WebDriver Fundamentals
- Browser Launch and Navigation
- WebDriver Commands and Methods
- Types of Web Elements
- Web Element Identification
- Web Element Interactions
- Practical Browser Automation

## Objective

To strengthen my software testing and automation skills through consistent hands-on practice, understand real-world browser automation workflows, and build a strong foundation in test automation.

